# Exercise 2
### Test 1: Valid course → 201
POST http://localhost:5000/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "CSE-101",
  "title": "Web Development",
  "maxCapacity": 30
}

###

### Test 2: Get course → 200
GET http://localhost:5000/api/courses/1

###

### Test 3: Empty body → 400
POST http://localhost:5000/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###

### Test 4: Wrong code format → 400
POST http://localhost:5000/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "abc",
  "title": "Test",
  "maxCapacity": 9999
}

###

### Test 5: Duplicate code → 409
POST http://localhost:5000/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "CSE-101",
  "title": "Another Course",
  "maxCapacity": 10
}

###

### Test 6: Not found → 404
GET http://localhost:5000/api/courses/9999



